@startuml Sequence Diagram - Overview Alur Keseluruhan Sistem
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam roundcorner 20
skinparam maxmessagesize 60

title Sequence Diagram - Overview Alur Keseluruhan Sistem SIBIT

actor User as user
participant "PlantingController" as plantingCtrl
participant "HarvestController" as harvestCtrl
participant "CertificationController" as certCtrl
participant "InventoryTypeController" as inventoryCtrl
participant "SaleController" as saleCtrl
participant "Database" as db

== Alur Lengkap: Penanaman → Panen → Sertifikasi → Stok → Penjualan ==

note over user, db #LightBlue
  **Alur Utama Sistem SIBIT**
  Dari penanaman hingga penjualan benih
end note

== 1. Proses Penanaman ==

user -> plantingCtrl: POST /plantings (data penanaman)
activate plantingCtrl
plantingCtrl -> db: INSERT INTO plantings
db --> plantingCtrl: planting_id
plantingCtrl --> user: success
deactivate plantingCtrl

== 2. Pencatatan Panen ==

user -> harvestCtrl: POST /harvests (data panen)
activate harvestCtrl
harvestCtrl -> db: INSERT INTO harvests\n(plant_id, planting_id, quantity, ...)
db --> harvestCtrl: harvest_id
harvestCtrl --> user: success
deactivate harvestCtrl

== 3. Proses Sertifikasi ==

user -> certCtrl: POST /certifications (data sertifikasi + laporan)
activate certCtrl
certCtrl -> db: INSERT INTO certifications\n(harvest_id, certification_status='dalam_proses')
db --> certCtrl: certification_id

certCtrl -> db: INSERT INTO certification_reports\n(certification_id, conclusion, ...)
db --> certCtrl: report_id

alt Conclusion = LULUS
    certCtrl -> db: UPDATE certifications\nSET certification_status = 'lulus'
    db --> certCtrl: updated
    certCtrl --> user: sertifikasi lulus
else Conclusion = TIDAK LULUS
    certCtrl -> db: UPDATE certifications\nSET certification_status = 'tidak_lulus'
    db --> certCtrl: updated
    certCtrl --> user: sertifikasi tidak lulus
end
deactivate certCtrl

== 4. Tambah ke Stok (jika Lulus) ==

alt Sertifikasi Lulus
    user -> inventoryCtrl: POST /seed-stock/{inventoryType}/add-certified-seed
    activate inventoryCtrl
    inventoryCtrl -> db: INSERT INTO inventory_type_seeds\n(inventory_type_id, plant_id, quantity, ...)
    db --> inventoryCtrl: seed_id
    
    inventoryCtrl -> db: INSERT INTO certification_report_inventory_type\n(certification_report_id, inventory_type_id)
    db --> inventoryCtrl: attached
    
    inventoryCtrl --> user: benih ditambahkan ke stok
    deactivate inventoryCtrl
    
    == 4a. Tambah Lot ke Bin ==
    user -> inventoryCtrl: POST /warehouse-locations/{warehouse}/bins/{bin}/inventory-lots
    activate inventoryCtrl
    inventoryCtrl -> db: INSERT INTO inventory_lots\n(inventory_type_id, warehouse_id, bin_id,\nproduction_id, initial_stock, current_stock, ...)
    db --> inventoryCtrl: lot_id
    
    inventoryCtrl -> db: INSERT INTO inventory_transactions\n(transaction_type='stok_masuk', ...)
    db --> inventoryCtrl: transaction_id
    
    inventoryCtrl --> user: lot ditambahkan ke bin
    deactivate inventoryCtrl
end

== 5. Proses Penjualan ==

user -> saleCtrl: POST /sales (data penjualan + items)
activate saleCtrl
saleCtrl -> db: BEGIN TRANSACTION

saleCtrl -> db: INSERT INTO sales\n(receipt_number, buyer_name, total_amount=0, ...)
db --> saleCtrl: sale_id

loop For each item
    saleCtrl -> db: SELECT * FROM inventory_lots\nWHERE bin_id = ?\nAND current_stock > 0\nORDER BY created_at ASC
    db --> saleCtrl: lots[] (FIFO)
    
    loop For each lot (FIFO)
        saleCtrl -> db: UPDATE inventory_lots\nSET current_stock = current_stock - ?\nWHERE id = ?
        db --> saleCtrl: updated
        
        saleCtrl -> db: INSERT INTO inventory_transactions\n(transaction_type='distribusi', ...)
        db --> saleCtrl: transaction_id
    end
    
    saleCtrl -> db: INSERT INTO sale_items\n(sale_id, inventory_type_id, quantity, ...)
    db --> saleCtrl: sale_item_id
end

saleCtrl -> db: UPDATE sales\nSET total_amount = ?\nWHERE id = ?
db --> saleCtrl: updated

saleCtrl -> db: COMMIT TRANSACTION
saleCtrl --> user: penjualan berhasil
deactivate saleCtrl

== Ringkasan Alur ==

note over user, db #LightGreen
  **Ringkasan:**
  1. Penanaman → Data penanaman disimpan
  2. Panen → Hasil panen dicatat
  3. Sertifikasi → Benih disertifikasi (LULUS/TIDAK LULUS)
  4. Stok → Benih lulus ditambahkan ke gudang
  5. Penjualan → Stok dikurangi menggunakan FIFO
end note

@enduml
















